# Passwordless sign-in: email, then a 6-digit code.
# Run with QA_EMAIL set to a fresh address, e.g. QA_EMAIL=qa-$(date +%s)@example.com
# The real code is only in the Convex log, so signing in with it is covered by
# scripts/smoke-auth.mjs. This flow checks the screens and a wrong code.
open /sign-in
wait until the Sign in heading is visible
expect a Send code button
expect no Password field
type $QA_EMAIL into Email
click Send code
wait until the Enter your code heading is visible
expect text that says a 6-digit code was sent to the email address
type 000000 into Code
click Continue
expect the message "That code is wrong. Check it and try again."
click Use a different email
expect the Sign in heading
